---
// src/components/Educational.astro
// Educational sections explaining pricing mechanics, volumetric weights, and shipping tips.
---

<section id="guides" class="py-20 border-t border-hairline bg-canvas-soft transition-colors duration-200">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Title -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="caption-mono text-mute uppercase tracking-widest block mb-3" data-i18n="guides-title-eyebrow">SHIPPING INTELLIGENCE</span>
      <h2 class="display-lg text-ink font-semibold" data-i18n="guides-title">How courier shipping works.</h2>
      <p class="body-md text-body mt-2" data-i18n="guides-subtitle">Learn the calculations and logistics concepts used by top shipping providers globally.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Grid Container -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Volumetric Weight -->
      <div class="bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-level-2 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-hairline-strong">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="p-2 bg-primary/5 text-ink rounded border border-hairline">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="display-sm text-lg text-ink font-medium" data-i18n="guides-card-1-title">What is volumetric weight?</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="body-sm text-body leading-relaxed mb-4" data-i18n="guides-card-1-desc">
          Courier companies bill you based on the space a package occupies rather than its actual physical weight if the box is large but light. This is called Volumetric Weight (or dimensional weight).
        </p>
        <div class="bg-canvas-soft-2 border border-hairline rounded p-4 mb-3 transition-colors duration-200">
          <span class="caption-mono uppercase text-mute tracking-wider block mb-1" data-i18n="guides-card-1-formula-title">THE FORMULA</span>
          <code class="code text-ink block font-semibold" data-i18n="guides-card-1-formula">Volumetric Weight (kg) = (Length × Width × Height in cm) / 5000</code>
        </div>
        <p class="caption text-mute" data-i18n="guides-card-1-note">
          If your parcel weights 2 kg physically but measures 30x30x30 cm, its volumetric weight is 5.4 kg. You will be billed for 6 kg (rounded up).
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Pricing breakdown -->
      <div class="bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-level-2 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-hairline-strong">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="p-2 bg-primary/5 text-ink rounded border border-hairline">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="display-sm text-lg text-ink font-medium" data-i18n="guides-card-2-title">How pricing is calculated</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="body-sm text-body leading-relaxed mb-4" data-i18n="guides-card-2-desc">
          Standard shipment quotes represent the combined sum of several dynamic cost factors:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 body-sm text-body">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-ink font-semibold select-none">•</span>
            <span data-i18n="guides-card-2-item-1"><strong>Base Courier Fee:</strong> Flat handling charge required for each booking.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-ink font-semibold select-none">•</span>
            <span data-i18n="guides-card-2-item-2"><strong>Weight Premium:</strong> Calculated on the higher of physical or volumetric weight.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-ink font-semibold select-none">•</span>
            <span data-i18n="guides-card-2-item-3"><strong>Distance Cost:</strong> Factored using transit corridors and distance between cities.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-ink font-semibold select-none">•</span>
            <span data-i18n="guides-card-2-item-4"><strong>Taxes & Duties:</strong> Local goods/services tax and duties applied by code.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Shipping Tips -->
      <div class="bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-level-2 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-hairline-strong">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="p-2 bg-primary/5 text-ink rounded border border-hairline">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="display-sm text-lg text-ink font-medium" data-i18n="guides-card-3-title">How to reduce shipping costs</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="body-sm text-body leading-relaxed mb-4" data-i18n="guides-card-3-desc">
          Optimize your shipping arrangements to save up to 40% on standard quotes:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 body-sm text-body">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-success font-semibold select-none">✓</span>
            <span data-i18n="guides-card-3-item-1"><strong>Pack efficiently:</strong> Use the smallest possible box to limit volumetric weight surcharges.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-success font-semibold select-none">✓</span>
            <span data-i18n="guides-card-3-item-2"><strong>Drop-off at hubs:</strong> Dropping items directly at courier locations bypasses pickup fees.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-success font-semibold select-none">✓</span>
            <span data-i18n="guides-card-3-item-3"><strong>Choose Standard Service:</strong> Unless highly urgent, standard surface routes cost 50% less than express air.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-success font-semibold select-none">✓</span>
            <span data-i18n="guides-card-3-item-4"><strong>Consolidate boxes:</strong> Multiple separate boxes cost more base charges than a single unified box.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Movers vs Courier -->
      <div class="bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-level-2 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-hairline-strong">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="p-2 bg-primary/5 text-ink rounded border border-hairline">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 7h12m0 0l-4-4m4 4l-4 4m0 6H4m0 0l4 4m-4-4l4-4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="display-sm text-lg text-ink font-medium" data-i18n="guides-card-4-title">Couriers vs. Packers & Movers</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="body-sm text-body leading-relaxed mb-4" data-i18n="guides-card-4-desc">
          Selecting the wrong shipping channel can drastically impact charges and parcel safety:
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-3.5">
          <div>
            <span class="body-sm-strong text-ink block" data-i18n="guides-card-4-sect-1-title">Standard/Express Couriers</span>
            <span class="body-sm text-body block" data-i18n="guides-card-4-sect-1-desc">Best for boxes under 35 kg, documents, books, or single electronics. Offers quick tracking and air delivery.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-hairline pt-3 transition-colors duration-200">
            <span class="body-sm-strong text-ink block" data-i18n="guides-card-4-sect-2-title">Packers & Movers</span>
            <span class="body-sm text-body block" data-i18n="guides-card-4-sect-2-desc">Best for furniture, heavy household shifting, vehicles, or items exceeding 100 kg. Includes wrapping, loading, and truck transport.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
